      "name": "Countless Digits",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Each other creature in the phalanx of phalanges' space takes 1d6 Piercing Damage damage ((1d6+2) Piercing Damage damage if the swarm is berserk) (Basic DC 17 Reflex Saving Throw). On a critical failure, the target is thoroughly pinned by the phalanges, becoming Immobilized until it Escapes or until any creature uses 2 Interact actions to scrape away the bones pinning them down.</p>",
